Implemented comprehensive memory monitoring and OOM prevention system for 4GB RAM systems. Added memory_monitor.py module with snapshot logging, spawn safety checks, and watchdog thread. Integrated monitoring into engine loop and worker spawning. Created macOS launchd service config and documentation. Added psutil dependency and 42 unit tests (syntax validated). System now logs memory at startup, periodically during main loop, and before/after worker spawns. Watchdog blocks spawns when memory < threshold. Includes startup warnings for low-RAM systems.